[I] A command-line multi-system emulator

[T] Mednafen is a portable, OpenGL and SDL based, argument-driven
[T] multi-system emulator. It emulates many video game consoles and
[T] handhelds, such as the Atari Lynx, Game Boy (Color/Advance), NES, SNES,
[T] Neo Geo Pocket, PC Engine, PC-FX, PlayStation, Sega Master System, Mega
[T] Drive, Saturn and Virtual Boy.

[U] https://mednafen.github.io/

[A] Mednafen Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

